🔧 Technical Implementation Journey
Phase 1: Initial Development Challenges
Problem: Enhanced component couldn't load PSA forms
Root Causes Identified:

API endpoint returning 404 errors
Environment variable mismatches (DOCUSEAL_API_KEY vs DOCUSEAL_API_TOKEN)
Template ID discrepancies (hardcoded 1 vs actual 1155842)
DocuSeal response parsing issues (array vs object structure)

Phase 2: Systematic Troubleshooting
API Authentication Resolution:

Updated environment variables to match DocuSeal requirements
Fixed variable name consistency across codebase
Verified API token functionality with DocuSeal cloud service

Response Parsing Correction:
javascript// Fixed: DocuSeal returns array, not object
const embedUrl = Array.isArray(data) && data.length > 0 
  ? data[0].embed_src 
  : data?.submitters?.[0]?.embed_url;
X-Frame-Options Resolution:

Replaced standard iframe with DocuSeal's <docuseal-form> component
Added DocuSeal script loading via useEffect
Implemented proper cleanup and event handling

Phase 3: Integration Success
Final Working Configuration:

Template ID: 1155842 (correctly configured)
API Endpoint: https://api.docuseal.com/submissions
Environment: DOCUSEAL_API_TOKEN=MZtmQ5gQNf3qEkbxJvLEtyWMRu5zHy4oLgDxw9aCpwX
Embed Method: <docuseal-form data-src="${embedSrc}"></docuseal-form>


